      "text": "Trusting the wrong people could have major consequences this morning, dearest Taurus. Guard your success and protect your energy from potential schemers while the Sagittarius Moon aligns with Pluto and Uranus. Pay extra attention to how you feel around those you trust as well. If you've noticed a pattern of toxicity taking root, address the issue sooner than later. Excuse yourself from triggering situations once Luna, Mars, and Saturn form a restorative grand trine this afternoon."
    },
