      "text": "Friends supportive and will keep you happy. Today, seek the blessings of your elders before going out of the house, as it will benefit you. Someone you trust will not be telling you the whole truth-Your ability to convince others will help you solve coming problems. You know the importance of personal space, and you are likely to get a lot of free time today. In this time, you can play a game or go to the gym."
